From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] git fetch: add native raw ref and stack fetching

Fetch one raw source ref into a remote bookmark through jj's Git
subprocess and import pipeline. Accept a remote name, URL, or path, and
optionally track the resulting bookmark in the same transaction.

For shallow repositories, fetch the complete stack above a requested
base and include exactly one parent as the oldest commit's diff base.
